      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adin%2C_California",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the mid‑1930s, Adin transformed into a sawmill town when the Edgerton Brothers Mill moved in from the nearby Adin Mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
